            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "For most stamped patios, a solvent-based acrylic is the best fit. It enhances color, bonds well when recoated, and cloudiness can often be fixed with solvent rather than stripping. Water-based acrylics are a good alternative where VOC rules apply or odor is a concern. Penetrating repellents protect but leave colors muted."
          }
