          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Some sealers are available tinted, which can refresh or shift faded colors. Tinted sealer adds color in the film, so it wears with the film and needs careful, even application to avoid streaks. Test on a small area first, and keep in mind that tinted sealer hides texture slightly."
