          <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-white mb-4">The Bottom Line</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            For most stamped patios and walkways, Foundation Armor AR350 is the best all-round sealer: rich color, a restrained sheen, and the repairability of solvent acrylic. Choose Eagle EU1 for maximum gloss at a lower price, Super Seal 25 or EnduraSeal for a semi-gloss middle ground, Techniseal Color Boost for faded colors, and Eagle Natural Seal only if you want no sheen at all.
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Whatever you pick, the finish depends on technique. Clean thoroughly, let the texture dry completely, apply two thin coats in mild weather, and add grit wherever people walk wet. Reseal every two to three years before the color wears through, and stay with compatible chemistry.
